1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Notes for Mary Ann Catharine MOORER: The 1937 Wannamaker Makay etc. book makes the error that this Mary Ann Catherine Moorer was the daughter of Samuel Moorer and Elizabeth Bowman. Samuel and Elizabeth did have a daughter named Ma
2 CONC ry but she was about 2 years old when Frederick Dantzler and Mary Ann Catherine Moorer married in June 1796. She was the only daughter of John Henry Moorer Sr. and his wife Sarah Felder. This is disputed by some Felder researchers
2 CONC  as children of Capt. Henry Felder Sr. seem to be well documented and no Sarah shown. Ernest S. Moorer in his Moorer Family History listed Sarah (Felder) Moorer as wife of John Henry Moorer and her year of birth as 1756 and daught
2 CONC er of Henry Felder in two different versions of the Moorer Family History.
