1 OCCU 1st Dantzler to arrive in SC
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hans Ulrich Denzler was baptized 8/3/1704 in First, Illnau Zurich Switzerland. He was the son of Heinrich Denzler and Barbara Brungger. He married Margreth Frauenfelder 4/6/1728 in First Illnau. She was baptized 4/
2 CONC 22/1708 in First Illnau 	Hans Ulrich brother was Conrad Denler who migrated with his family to Savannah, GA arriving 12/20/1737 On 12/23/1749, Hans Ulrich sold his land in Switzerland to his brother Heinrich Denzler. The deed was 
2 CONC registered at the castle Kyburg on 1/16/1750. The transaction listed a number of properties. Hans Ulrich received a warrant for 400 acres of land near Saxe Gotha on 8/29/1750 but on 6/4/1751 petitioned that it be laid out near Fou
2 CONC r Hole Swamp instead. The 400 acres was granted to Hans Ulrich on 11/6/1752 and was located 2 ½ m southeast of what is now the center of Cameron, SC Jericho Rod where it leaves US 176 in present day Calhoun Cty.
