3 TEXT Colonial Grant records have at least 3 different names for the same individual connected with the known wife and 3 children of the person known as Lewis J. Carn. The names Johann Ludwig Kern, Lodvick Kern, Ludwig Kern are all asso
4 CONC ciated with the wife and 3 known children of Lewis J. Carn. Grant records also include Lewis Carne, Lewis Cairn and the last grant record has Lewis Carn.
2 OBJE
3 FILE https://media.geni.com/p13/99/34/9a/95/53444860f83d88ab/ffam_original.png?hash=6c6c3478ff3fc81d3d8a4e9d9218cc50c1a2c9afe771ac74d45a7e3532435cca.1795075199
3 FORM png
3 TITL First Family
1 SOUR
2 DATA
3 DATE 12 MAY 2022
3 TEXT Place of Birth
3 TEXT Possibly Lampertheim. His known wife, Catherina Elisabeth Strubel, is noted as being born in Lamperthiem, Hessen, Germany and this suggest Ludwig (Lewis J.) was born nearby.
