2 CONT
2 CONT Death of Mrs. Susan Arant
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Susan Arant, of Lower St. Matthews, departed this life on last Sunday morning week ago in her eighty seventh year. She was for many years a member of Jericho Methodist Church, and lived and died a true and devoted Christian. 
2 CONC She leaves a large family connection and hosts of friends to mourn her death.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Published in the Times and Democrat 6/29/1892  (Wednesday)
2 CONT
