1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==GEDCOM Note==
2 CONT
2 CONT Bible records from ''The Granny Stewart Bible'', stereotyped and published by C. Alexander Co., Athenian Building, Franklin Place, 1834 Philadelphia:
2 CONT
2 CONT > Elizabeth was a member of Bush River Baptist Church before she moved to Ohio with her first husband, Jerry Goggans and her children. Two of her 3 children and her husband died. She eventually returned to S.C. with her son Daniel
2 CONC , and rejoined Bush River Baptist Church. She then married Joe Stewart.
2 CONT
