2 CONT John C Stewart died childless even though he raised Mary Josephine Peterson who was an orphan and related thru the Stewart/Peterson line. Mary Josephine's parents were David Thomas Peterson (uncle to John C. Stewart) & Susan Carol
2 CONC ine Abney. John became Mary's guardian in 1848.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Josephine Peterson married John Spearman Floyd.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the 1870, Floyds township, Newberry Co., SC census, it shows Mary as being 24 years old and teaching school.
2 CONT
2 CONT John was a magistrate in Newberry Co., SC in 1852.
