2 CONT David Peterson, an elder brother of Rev. James F. Peterson, was pastor of Sardis Baptist Church in  Edgefield Co., SC about the year 1825. He was a native of Newberry. He married a widow Strother, sister of James Richardson, of Ri
2 CONC chardsonville, and mother of Major William A. Strother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth date for David Peterson comes from a undated, undocumentd copy of a family bible record in the possession of ( at one time) J. F. Peterson, copies of this bible record has surfaced many time in many places.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death of David Peterson is noted in the Equity Court Case of William Wilson vs. William Langford et al. Filed 14 May 1828 in the Equity Court of Newberry County South Carolina.
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
