2 CONT Nancy was the daughter of Paul and Martha Williams. She married Daniel Goggans in 1747, and they were the parents of 5 sons and 5 daughters. She was a direct descendant of Roger Williams, founder of the Colony of Rhode Island and 
2 CONC crusader for religious freedom.
