1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Gemima Mangum''' was born circa 1763 in Culpeper, Culpeper County, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gemima married [https://www.geni.com/profile-19161375 John Wesley Magnum, Jr.] circa 1802 in Newberry,Newberry,South Carolina. Together they had the following children:
