1 NOTE {geni:about_me} PARENT CONFLICT - parents reported as Daniel Riley and Kasiah Riley and David Riley and Mary Inabinet.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Asbury Riley BIRTH	30 Oct 1837 Orangeburg County, South Carolina, USA DEATH	24 Nov 1917 (aged 80) Coahoma, Howard County, Texas, USA BURIAL	 Coahoma Cemetery Coahoma, Howard County, Texas
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/84826134/daniel-asbury-riley - shows parents as Daniel Riley and Mary Inabinet [she was stepmother, as they married in  1841).
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel married Ella Barbara Pooser (b1843 in SC - d 1881 in GA) in December 1866 and had eight children (Francis, Daniel, George, Mary, Henry, Russell, & John) before Ella died giving birth to twins (Ella & Anna) that also died in
2 CONC  1881.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel married Sara Jane Vinson in 1882 and had one daughter named Martha.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father is Daniel Riley (1799-1878) of Orangeburg, SC. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel married Kasiah in Orangeburg, South Carolina about 1830.  They had 7 children. Mary Elizabeth Riley, Ann Riley, Rachel Irene Riley, John E. Riley, George W. Riley, Maria L. Riley, and Daniel Asbury Riley.  Kasiah Passed awa
2 CONC y 1840 in Orangeburg South Carolina. After Kasiah passed away, Daniel married Mary Inabinet May 1841. Mary was Daniel’s brother’s widow. Mary’s 1st husband David Riley died about 1840.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel and Mary had three children. Caroline or Carrie E. Riley, Jacob Rhett Riley. The third child passed away at birth (birth year and gender are unknown at this time).
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary and Daniel had  Daniel and Kasiah's children living with them.  They also had Mary and David Riley's children living with them (Mary's 1st husband) Lastly, Mary and Daniel had their 2 children living with them.
2 CONT
2 CONT The census records are confusing because there are children from 3 different marriages living with Daniel and Mary.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
