2 CONT # George Wallace Riley 1871–1936
2 CONT # Mary Lizzie Riley Hickman 1874–1973
2 CONT # Henry Edward Riley 1875–1968
2 CONT # Russell Emanuel Riley 1877–1958
2 CONT # John Wesley Riley 1879–1952
2 CONT # Martha Alberta Riley Morgan 1884–1969
2 CONT
