2 CONT Fairfield Recorder - 23 Dec 1910 issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Blackmon, mother of T. G. Blackmon, died at the home of her son, at Teague, last Thursday, and her remains were interred in the Fairfield cemetery the following day. 
2 CONT Deceased was about 89 years of age, and was one of the oldest pioneer residents of the county at the time of her death.
2 CONT Courtesy of Eric Wood
