2 CONT Burial: Fort Ogden Cemetery  Fort Ogden DeSoto County Florida, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT THE TAMPA TRIBUNE (TAMPA, FLORIDA) 10/8/1962
2 CONT
2 CONT MRS. LEILA W. SULLIVAN BRADENTON (Special)---Mrs. Leila Williams Sullivan 78, of 322 14th St E. died Thursday at Manatee Veterans Memorial Hospital. She was a native of Fort Ogden and came here from New York City last May. She was
2 CONC  a registered nurse in New York hospitals for 47 years until her retirement. Survivors include a son J.C. Parler Sr., of California; two sisters, Mrs. Vancilla Partridge and Mrs Wanda Locke of Bradenton; six grandchildren and 19 g
2 CONC reat-grandchildren.
