2 CONT *''Obituary''
2 CONT *Canton-Hazel W. Ramsey, age 89 died Wednesday, April 30, 2003 at Haywood Regional Medical Center.
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''He''' was a native of Sumter County, SC and had lived most of his life in Haywood County. '''He''' was the son of the late Ralph and Una Ramsey of Sumter, SC and was a member of Canton Central United Methodist Church. He was a
2 CONC  former mayor of Canton, a member of the N.C. Safety Advisory.....<br/>
2 CONT <br/>'''He''' is survived by his wife of 64 years, Virginia Bryson Ramsey and several nieces and nephews.
