2 CONT Matilda Goggans is the daughter of Daniel Goggans bc 1770-d July 29, 1803 married c. 1800 Newberry Co., SC to Naomi Peterson b Feb. 2, 1778 Craven? Co. , SC-d Dec. 20,1843 Newberry Co., SC. Matilda Goggans is the granddaughter of 
2 CONC George Goggans and Sarah Butler. Her maternal grandparents are Thomas Peterson bc 1856-d May 15, 1827 Edgefield Co., SC married Sept. 12, 1776 to Abigail Richardson bc 1758-d June 5, 1825 in Edgefield Co., SC. Matilda Goggans is t
2 CONC he great-granddaughter of William Goggans bc 1700 County Cork Ireland- lived in Richmond and Lunenberg Co., Va.-dc 1766 Culpepper Co., Va. married 1729 to Elizabeth Beal bc 1715 in Lunenberg Parish, Richmond Va.-dc 1766 Bromfield 
2 CONC Parish, Culpepper Co., Va.
2 CONT
