2 CONC rs of Beaver dam Creek...he left the following people as his only heirs at law, Catharine Bryson, his widow and second wife, two sons and two daughters, to wit, John H. Bryson, who resides out of said state, James H. Bryson, of La
2 CONC urens, Mary Bryson and Catherine Peterson who was the wife of Wilford F. Peterson...who has since died leaving Wilford F. Peterson and Nancy Margaret Peterson, her only child, as her only distributees..."
