1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT David Thomas Peterson was the son of Rev. David Thomas Peterson b. 15 May 1782 d. 7 April 1827 and Mary Polly Turner Peterson b. 20 June 1788 d. 11 March 1845.
2 CONT
2 CONT David Thomas Peterson and Susan Caroline Abney were married 10 Jan 1841.
2 CONT
2 CONT It's stated in the family papers that he died of pneumonia. His wife, Susan Caroline Abney Peterson died about 7 weeks after his death, also of pneumonia. This left their children, Warren Greene Peterson and Josephine "Jo" Peterso
2 CONC n orphans. They were taken in and raised by different family members. See the links for Warren Greene Peterson and Josephine Peterson Floyd for more information.
1 FAMC @F6000000090357960280@
1 FAMS @F6000000090357960298@
