1 NAME Teresa (Taressa) (Tansye) Almena /Goggans/
2 GIVN Teresa (Taressa) (Tansye) Almena
2 SURN Goggans
2 _MARNM Radford
1 NAME Teresa Almena Radford (Goggans)
1 SEX F
