2 CONT
2 CONT * William Bennett Peterson, 1794 - 1873
2 CONT * William Bennett Peterson was born on February 23 1794, in Pendleton, West Virginia, to William Peterson and Mary Peterson.
2 CONT * William had 3 siblings: Sally Peterson, Lemuel Davis Peterson and Abigail Peterson.
2 CONT * William married Margaret Peterson on February 11 1816, at age 21 in Lewis County, West Virginia.
2 CONT * They had 12 children: Talitha Stanley, Mary Peterson, Jesse Lawrence Peterson, Anna Lee Peterson, James R Peterson, Nancy Peterson, Elizabeth Peterson, Hanson Miles Peterson, Rebecca Peterson, William Henry Peterson, Perry Granv
2 CONC ille Peterson and Margaret Lowther Peterson.
2 CONT * William passed away on September 20 1873, at age 79 in Humphreys, Sullivan County, Missouri.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Residence''': Taylor, Sullivan, Missouri - 1870
