2 CONT 1-3 William Goggans, b. 1740 Lunenburg Parish, Va., d. 1834, Newberry Co., SC at home on Sandy Run. m. Elizabeth Butler, b. ca. 1744 Va., m. 1760 Va., d. before 1830, Newberry Co., SC, daughter of John and Elizabeth (Bailey) Butle
2 CONC r.
