2 CONT 1-4 James Goggans, b. Sept. 16, 1751 Va., d. Oct. 25, 1826 SC, (Family Bible Record) m. Mary Johnston,15 b. 1752, m. 1769 SC, d. 1816 Newberry Co., SC, daughter of Thomas & Elizabeth Jane (Dalrymple) Johnston, pioneers from Onslow
2 CONC , Col, NC to SC.
