2 CONT
2 CONT Paul Williams (son of Jeremiah Williams and Miss Brown) was born Abt. 1690 in Philadelphia, and died 1754 in S.Carolina. He married Martha Williams.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Paul Williams: Comment 1: Mill on 200 acres on Second R.. Comment 2: Located between Broad & Saluda Riv's. Comment 3: Land from King 11-30-1750. Ethnicity/Relig.: Baptist. Event 1: April 7, 1755, Got 200 Ac on 2nd Crk f
2 CONC rm Jer & Jean Wms. Event 2: September 9, 1765, Will 200Ac nephew Jhn Pearson-raise 3 kids. Event 3: Grst Mill. Occupation: Plantation owner and Grist mill operator. Personality/Intrst: Could read and write. Residence: Newberry SC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Paul Williams and Martha Williams are: +Daniel Williams, b. Abt. 1720, Philadelphia, d. 1765, S. Carolina. David Williams, b. Abt. 1710, d. 1764, SC. +Elizabeth Williams, b. Abt. 1721, Philadelphia. +Jeremiah Williams,
2 CONC  b. Abt. 1723, Philadelphia, d. Abt. 1770, Newberry SC. Paul Williams, b. Abt. 1710, RI?, d. 1810, Charlston. SC.
2 CONT
