1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''James Franklin Mangum, Sr.''' was born circa 1785 in Bush River, Newberry, South Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-33377424 William Mangum] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-62575450 Ann or
2 CONC  Anna Goggans]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on October 1, 1825, in Newberry Co., South Carolina, United States, and was buried in Mangum Family Burying Ground. 
