2 CONT Rev. Daniel Mangum, who did more to build up the Baptist Church in the upper part of Newberry County than any other man has ever done. Pastor for 26 years at Bush River Baptist Church, Newberry, South Carolina. Died at age 64. Bur
2 CONC ied in Bush River Church Cemetery.
