1 NAME Thomas George /Ulmer/
2 GIVN Thomas George
2 _MARNM Ulmer
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 18 APR 1816
2 ADDR
3 STAE Indiana
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 JAN 1898
2 ADDR
