1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth: 	Sep. 28, 1819 Vienna Scott County Indiana, USA Death: 	Mar. 2, 1888 Pickering Nodaway County Missouri, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Hamilton Ulmer was born on September 28, 1819 in Vienna Indiana. He was the son of George and Elizabeth (Wardell) Ulmer. He was married to Lucinda Vaughn on May 31, 1849 in Jackson, Indiana, There were eight children (that w
2 CONC e are aware of at this at this time) born to this couple.  The names of these children included; Sarah Catarina Ulmer, b. 1843 George C. Ulmer, b. 1851 Jacob Hamilton Ulmer, jr., 1856 Newton J. Ulmer, b. 1859 Nancy M. Ulmer, Henri
2 CONC etta J. Ulmer, b. 1863 William S. Ulmer, b. 1868 Callie Ulmer, b. 1872. Jacob passed away on March 2, 1888 and was laid to rest in Fasken Cemetery in Carthage, Mo. next to his wife, Lucinda. 
2 CONT
