1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Warren Greene Peterson, was 16 in this photo taken in 1861. He was with the 3rd SCV Co. B. He was wounded 5 times during the Civil War, twice in the same hip. His last battle was at the Wilderness where he was wounded for the seco
2 CONC nd time in his hip. He walked with a limp the rest of his life. (Source: Barbara Holloway Smith)
