1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Ogletree served in the Confederate Army during the American Civil War. He first enlisted in May 1862 in Company C, Alabama Hilliard's 3rd Infantry Battalion. On November 25th 1863 Hilliard's Legion was disband
2 CONC ed and John Ogletree was reassigned to Company B, Alabama 60th Infantry Regiment. He was mustered out on 09 Apr 1865 at Appomattox, VA. 
2 CONT *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hilliard's_Legion
