2 CONT https://www.colonialsociety.org/node/2858, Colonial Society of Massachusetts, Vol. 86 The Papers of Francis Bernard, Vol 4, 1768; Col. William Dalrymple, letter, Boston, June 10 1768
2 CONT
2 CONT and, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Independence_(Massachusetts),
2 CONT
