2 CONC na, United States, S213032, South Carolina Department of Archives and History, Columbia
2 CONT ## "United States Census, 1800," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:XH5R-ZFG : accessed 22 May 2021), Nicholas Zorn, Orange, Orangeburg District, South Carolina, United States; citing p. 50
2 CONC 7, NARA microfilm publication M32, (Washington D.C.: National Archives and Records Administration, n.d.), roll 49; FHL microfilm 181,424
2 CONT ## "United States Census, 1810," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:XH2S-CPR : accessed 22 May 2021), Nicholas Zorn, Barnwell, Barnwell, South Carolina, United States; citing p. 146, NARA m
2 CONC icrofilm publication M252 (Washington D.C.: National Archives and Records Administration, n.d.), roll 60; FHL microfilm 181,419
