2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Nicholas Zorn and Anna Catherine Unknown are:
2 CONT
2 CONT b. SUSANNAH ZORN, born abt. 1729-1733. She married SETH HATCHER about 1750 (his second wife)[6]. Hatcher was born about 1686 in Virginia[6] and died 26 Sep 1756, Orangeburgh, South Carolina, "aged about 70 years"[3,4]. He was buri
2 CONC ed the next day on his plantation[3,4]. Seth Hatcher platted 300 acres on the Pon Pon, adjacent to Nicholas Zorn, on 13 Dec 1735[13]. and received his grant on 17 Sep 1736[14].
