2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Floyd Mobley Crum BIRTH	16 Mar 1815 Jones County, Georgia, USA DEATH	30 Dec 1868 (aged 53) Rockwest, Wilcox County, Alabama, USA BURIAL	 Burford Cemetery Wilcox County, Alabama, USA  MEMORIAL ID	53822638 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWERS 2 Sarah Floyd Mobley Crum is my husband's 2nd GG Aunt. She married Abraham Sebastian Crum April 28, 1831 in Wilcox Co., Alabama. Sarah was the daughter of Daniel Mobley and Sarah Mobley McReynolds and the
2 CONC  sister of GG Grandfather, Elbert Hill Jackson Mobley. Together Sarah and Abraham Crum had 6 known children: Martha Mobley Crum (Burford), Levi D. Crum, William Peyton Crum, Augustus W. Crum, Floyd Edward Crum and Sarah "Sallie" F
2 CONC unchess Crum (Cook).
2 CONT
