1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Harriet Ann Trotti''' was born circa 1798 in South Carolina, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-72628122 Joshua Harley] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-72628134 Elizabeth Leah Harley]. She was a Hou
2 CONC sewife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Harriet married [https://www.geni.com/profile-72136530 James Francis Trotti] in 1820 in Barnwell County, SC, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871176 John Lawrence Trotti]; [
2 CONC https://www.geni.com/profile-109871148 Edmond H Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871199 Caroline Elizabeth Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871258 Harriet Ann Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871272 Eliz
2 CONC a Jane Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-72175835 Clinton C. Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-72121977 James Hampton Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871289 Julia A Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109869
2 CONC 788 Joshua Frances Trotti]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 1, 1854 in Jasper, Jasper, Texas, United States and was buried circa August 1, 1854 there. 
2 CONT ----
