2 CONT According to William Schuler Jr., Roy was worked very hard and beaten by his Uncle George Shumaker and ran away back to Savannah.&nbsp; He was taken in by his father Harvey's woman friend, cleaned up and fed.&nbsp; When Harvey wen
2 CONC t to beat him she told him to leave him alone.&nbsp; Roy had the roughest life of all Harvey and Addie's children.&nbsp;
