2 CONT LOST CORNER NEAR BIRDSTON, June 18th
2 CONT   A young man arrived at Mr. J. L. Robinson's whose name we believe is J. P. Robinson, Jr., in consequence of which his papa is all smiles. Mother and baby are doing well. - NEMO
2 CONT -----------------------
