1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Kathryn was the little daughter of Pro. Walter Stewart Peterson and Julia Norris Milhous Peterson. Her father was teaching at Bethel College in Hopskinsville when Kathryn died. She went to church on March 28, 1915, and complained 
2 CONC of a sore throat after coming home. She died of diptheria on Monday, March 29, 1915. Her parents were unable to bring her body back to SC when they moved back.
