1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Caroline was the daughter of Prof. Walter Stewart Peterson and Julia Norris Milhous Peterson. She married William Jordan Holloway MD on Sept. 6, 1936. They have 4 children
2 CONT William Osce Holloway Oct 21, 1937
2 CONT Jordan Michael Holloway Jan 29, 1940
2 CONT John Teddy Holloway Oct 21, 1944
2 CONT Barbara Caroline Holloway Smith July 15, 1951
2 CONT
2 CONT "Ma" loved to cook for her family, her flowers, sewing and quilting, reading and loved nature. She was always interested in everything that was going on around her. In the 1970's and 80's, she worked diligently to preserve the his
2 CONC tory of Chappells and documented the old cemeteries and historic houses in the area.
