2 CONT Served as a private in the Civil War (Confederate). Regiment name  was 3rd Battalion, Hilliard's Legion, AL Volunteers. Commanded by Lieutenant Colonel John W. A. Sanford & Major Hatch Cook. On November 25, 1863 Hilliard's Legion 
2 CONC disbanded and Robert Salter was reassigned to Company B, 60th Alabama Infantry Regiment.
