1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT MARION P JONES
2 CONT
2 CONT Augusta, Feb 17 [1931] - Marion Pickens Jnes, 36, died at Augusta this afternoon at 3:40 o'clock. Funeral services will be held at Spann Methodist church of Ward, Wednesday afternoon at 5 o'clock, the Rev W A Reiser officiating.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving Mr Jones are his widow, Marion Easterling Jones; one son, Marion, Jr; one daughter, Martha Jones; two brothers, Dr Leslie Jones, Augusta, and Capers Jones, Langley, and one sister, Mrs J S Reese, Roanoke, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Feb 18, 1931 The State
