1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rebecca married 1st Thomas Goggans b. 1798, he died in Alabama. Her sister Mary Teague was married to Jehu W Pitts in SC and after both spouses died, Rebecca Teague Goggans married Jehu Pitts, her sisters widower. 
2 CONC Mary d. 1836 and is buried in the Poplar Springs Baptist Church Cemetery, Ware Shoals, Laurens County,SC.
2 CONT Jehu and Rebecca moved to MS 1836-1845, both are buried at Cherry Creek. 82 years, 5 mo, 8 days
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/107973848/rebecca-goggans_pitts
