1 NAME Elizabeth /Sharparowe/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Sharparowe
2 _MARNM Browne
2 NICK Sharparowe
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE MAY 1604
2 ADDR
3 CITY Melchbourne
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 31 DEC 1672
2 ADDR
