2 CONT Brief Life History of Jeremiah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jeremiah Browne was born about 1638, his father, Chad Browne, was 37 and his mother, Elizabeth Sharparowe, was 36. He married Mary about 1672. They were the parents of at least 3 sons. He died before 30 October 1690, in Newpo
2 CONC rt, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, and was buried in Common Ground Cemetery, Newport, Newport, Rhode Island, United States.
