2 CONC PA9. Google Books (http://books.google.com : accessed 23 January 2015).
2 CONT ↑ 2.0 2.1 Friends Records of Newport
2 CONT ↑ William Bradford Browne, “Chad Browne of Providence, R. I., and Four Generations of His Descendants,” New England Historical and Genealogical Register 80 (1926): 73-86, 170-85
