2 CONT The only information available about these infants is what's engraved on their shared headstone. Their parents aren't specified, but Helen Mangum was shown in both 1900 and 1010 as giving birth to 6 children, of whom only 3 were s
2 CONC till alive. Among her sisters-in-law, she's the only Mangum mother of that timeframe in Uvalde that had so many of her offspring die young; It's likely that both Carrie May and "Baby Mangum", the sibling (gender unknown) born a ye
2 CONC ar earlier, are children of John Abercrombie Mangum and Helen Steele.
