1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Frank Ulmer was born on May 8, 1877 in Nodaway, Missouri. He was the son of the late George and Eliza (Lutz) Ulmer. Frank was married to Lucy. During his life Frank worked as a farmer until he became ill. Frank passed away on May 
2 CONC 20, 1951 in the Harmony Hill Resthaven Nursing Facility after having complications with several illnesses. He was laid to rest in Hopkins Cemetery located in Hopkins, Missouri. 
