1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joseph Ulmer was born July 9, 1868 in Nodaway County, Missouri. He was the son of George M. and Judith A. (Murphy) Ulmer. Joseph was married to Ella May (Gray) Ulmer. He worked his entire adult life as a farmer. Mr
2 CONC . Ulmer passed away on July 11, 1944. His death was due to chronic valvular heart disease. He was laid to rest in Hopkins Cemetery. 
