1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Samuel Lutz was born on February 24, 1840 in Knox County, Ohio. He was the son of the late Jacob and Sarah Lutz. Samuel was married to Janette Thompson Ulmer on September 20, 1866 and they were married for 53 years
2 CONC  until she preceeded him in death on February 10, 1920. Mr. Lutz worked as a farmer unti his retirement. He passed away on December 21, 1921 from cardiac failure. He was laid to rest in Hopkins Cemetery in Pickering, Missouri.
