1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth: 	Jul. 7, 1885 Barry County Missouri, USA Death: 	Aug. 31, 1973 La Mirada Los Angeles County California, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT She was first married to Grover Vest and was in labor with Anna Bell (b: 1912 Oklahoma) when he left Molly; never returned. (interesting since his sister had married one of Molly's brothers) Later Molly met Eugene Gheller who has 
2 CONC a daughter from his previous marriage. Gene and Aunt Molly never had children. It is noted that the two girls were very close even though they were step-sisters. provided by Phyllis Hartman
2 CONT
2 CONT the 1920 census states her as widowed. Molly didn't married Eugene until in 1924. 
