1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joseph Thomas Melugin was the oldest of two children born to Samuel J. and Callie A. (Ulmer) Melugin. He was born on September 27, 1891 in Carthage, Mo. He worked as a farmer all of his adult life before becoming s
2 CONC eriously ill and suddenly passing away from heart disease at the age of 49.  Survivors include his mother, Mrs. Callie Melugin and sister, Eliza Catherine Ann Melugin of the home. His father, Samuel Melugin Passed away in 1917. He
2 CONC  was laid to rest in the family burial plot in Harvey Cemetery in LaRussell, Missouri. 
