2 CONT 2. Henry Hutto Jr, born ca 1788 SC, died 1818, married Mary _____They had three children- two sons and a daughter, born 1800-09.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT Henry Hutto Jr. was born between 1784-1788. He married Mary Ann Zeigler around 1806, in Barnwell Co., SC. Her maiden name may have been spelled Zeagler. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children;'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter b about 1805-1809
2 CONT
2 CONT Son b about 1805-1809
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob K Hutto b 1810 SC. Married Martha (?) about 1939. 1846-1853, He was a Justice of the Peace in Dale Co.  He is know to have a six children in the 1850 census. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Andrew Jackson Hutto''' b 1813. He was reportedly killed at the siege of Vicksburg in the service of the CSA between May-June 1863
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicholas Hutto b 1817 SC. Married Emily (?). Possibly died in the war between the states.
2 CONT
