1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Timothy was born in Screven County to the son of William Arnette, he was married twice... His first wife was Zenia Emanuel , daughter of Alexander Emanuel also of Screven County... By first wife children : (1) Wil
2 CONC liam, (2) Lucy, (3) Dicy, (4) Peter, (5) John  .. After the first wife passed , Timothy married Margaret Wilson , daughter of Joseph Wilson of South Carolina ... By second wife children : (1) Matilda, (2) Winnie, (3) Elizabeth, (4
2 CONC ) Susan  .. Living in Screven County until 1840 when they moved to Appling County and settled in the eastern part of town until the passed away and was buried in Wayne County area by now in Flint Branch Cemetery...
