2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HT-DHR3-Y9V?i=54&cc=1401638&personaUrl=%2Fark%3A%2F61903%2F1%3A1%3AM8QK-BQW - 1850 census
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Daniel married Kasiah in Orangeburg, South Carolina about 1823. They had 7 children. Mary Elizabeth Riley, Ann Riley, Rachel Irene Riley, John E. Riley, George W. Riley, Maria L. Riley, and Daniel Asbury Riley.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kasiah Passed away 1840 in Orangeburg South Carolina.
2 CONT After Kasiah passed away
2 CONT Daniel Married Mary Inabnit (Mary was Daniel's brothers David widow (David passed on)
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Married Mary Inabinet (this marriage was Mary's 2nd marriage. Her first husband passed away); 13 May 1841 in Orangeburg, South Carolina.
2 CONT They had three children. Caroline or Carrie E. Riley, Jacob Rhett Riley. The third child passed away at birth (birth year and gender are unknown at this time).
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary and Daniel had
2 CONT Daniel and Kasiah's children living with them.
2 CONT They also had Mary and David Riley's children living with them (Mary's 1st husband)
2 CONT Lastly, Mary and Daniel had their 2 children living with them.
2 CONT
2 CONT The census records are confusing because there are children from 3 different marriages living with Daniel and Mary. 
2 CONT
2 CONT per https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LZJD-FH7
2 CONT ----
