1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/4914107/person/-978451624 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 30 2018, 19:32:53 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Winfred Turner Ulmer Blue was born March 06, 1842 in Mississippi to the parents of  James T. and Nancy Turner Green Ulmer.  
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Cameron Blue and together had six children: Andrew, John William, Mary Rebecca, Martha Jane, James Peter, and Margaret Elizabeth.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Winfred died April 25, 1935 in DeSoto Parish Louisiana and is buried in Zions Rest Cemetery which is in the same Parish.   
2 CONT
2 CONT John Cameron Blue's parents were John Andrew and Margaret Cameron Blue. Genealogy information courtesy of Elaine Blue* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/13893576/winifred_turner_blue Find A Grave Memorial] - [https:/
