2 CONT Benjamin F Cox (Tobias, John Charles, John Cox)was born 1824 Jasper Co Mississippi died 1875 Winn Parish Louisiana. Married Susan E Killen in 1852. Benjamin and family came to Louisiana in early 1870. Served CSA Co B 5th MS Infant
2 CONC ry.
