2 CONT Descendants of John KILLEN Generation No. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. JOHN2 KILLEN (WILLIAM1) (Source: Who Married Whom - Jasper County, Mississippi - Book 1 A-K (1994).) was born 1802 in Tennessee. He married CHARITY (Source: Who Married Whom - Jasper County, Mississippi - Book 1 A-K (1994).) 18
2 CONC 27. She was born 1811 in Tennessee.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOHN KILLEN and CHARITY are:
2 CONT        i.        WILLIAM3 KILLEN, b. 1828.
2 CONT        ii. SUSANNAH KILLEN, b. 1832. + B.F. COX
2 CONT        iii.       NANCY KILLEN, b. 1834.
