1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''James Francis Trotti''' was born circa 1795 in Orangeburg, Orangeburg, South Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-72136715 Gaspar Joseph Trotti, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-72136725 M
2 CONC ary Trotti]. He was a Farmer . 
2 CONT
2 CONT James married [https://www.geni.com/profile-72136638 Harriet Ann Trotti] in 1820 in Barnwell County, SC, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871176 John Lawrence Trotti]; [http
2 CONC s://www.geni.com/profile-109871148 Edmond H Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871199 Caroline Elizabeth Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871258 Harriet Ann Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871272 Eliza Ja
2 CONC ne Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-72175835 Clinton C. Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-72121977 James Hampton Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109871289 Julia A Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-109869788 
2 CONC Joshua Frances Trotti]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James married [https://www.geni.com/profile-72628499 Nancy R. Trotti] on June 15, 1854 in Newton, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-75071726 Wiley H Trotti]; [https://www
2 CONC .geni.com/profile-75071706 Mary K Trotti]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766247523 Dora Baker]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-75071688 Nancy Josephine Trotti]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 9, 1870 in Newton, Newton, Texas, United States and was buried on August 9, 1870 there. 
2 CONT ----
