2 CONT
2 CONT * US General Land Office Records 1796-1907: James purchased 40.21 acres in Tallahassee Leon, Florida on 20 Oct 1835.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1840 US Federal Census shows residence in Leon, Florida Territory: 1 Free White Male Under 5 (Joshua); 1 Free White Male 10 thru 14 (James); 3 Free White Males 15 thru 19 (Edmond?, John and ?) 1 Free White Male 40 thru 49 (James
2 CONC  F 45) 1 Free White Female Under 5 (?); 1 Free White Female 5  thru 9 (Julia); 2 Free White Females 10 thru 14 (Harriet & Jane);  1 Free White Female 40 thru 49 (Harriett)
2 CONT
