2 CONT
2 CONT West Columbia - Funeral services for George Harley Fitts, 91, will be held at 3:00 p.m. Thursday, August 26, 2010 at Caughman-Harman Funeral Home, West Columbia Chapel, with interment in Southland Memorial Gardens. The family will
2 CONC  receive friends from 1:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m. prior to the service at the funeral home. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Fitts was born April 18, 1919 in Brunson, SC and passed away on Monday, August 23, 2010. He was a son of the late Robert Raymond Fitts and Beulah Harley Fitts. Mr. Fitts was an electrician and he loved to work. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Fitts is survived by his sons, George Herbert Fitts of Charleston, Ernest Ray Fitts (Leslie) of Lexington, Harry Fitts Collins of Boiling Springs; daughter, Glenda Fitts Hinson of Rock Hill; son, Donald Reed Fitts of West Colu
2 CONC mbia; daughters, Brenda Fitts of West Columbia, Celia Fitts Morrow of Lexington, Delia Fitts Bowen of West Columbia; son, Esten "Bubba" Fitts of West Columbia; daughter, Pamela "Pam" Fitts Golightly of West Columbia; brother, Ralp
2 CONC h Fitts (Marie) of Charleston; 17 grandchildren and 9 great-grandchildren. He was predeceased by his parents; wives, Peggy Fisher Fitts and Annie Cattles Fitts; 4 sisters and 3 brothers. 
