1 CONT Captain John Browne and his brother Capt. Peregrine Browne ran two of the best equiped merchant transports between London and Annapolis.
0 @N6000000002336748854@ NOTE Elder John Brown was a noted minister and succeded his father the Rec. Chad Brown as pastor of the First Baptist Church at Providence, the oldes Baptist Church in America.  Married Mary Holmes, daughter of Rev. Obe(a)diah Holmes, 
1 CONC first pastor of the First Baptist Church at Newport, RI.  Brown was one of the Commissioners of the General Court in 1655-1658 and in 1676 was one of the Councillors for the General Assembly of the Colony in the troublesome Indian
1 CONC  War.
